<title>UK: Cypriot bulker refloated at Buenos Aires.</title>
<headline>Cypriot bulker refloated at Buenos Aires.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cypriot bulk carrier Oliver Spirit was refloated on Friday with tug assistance and no apparent damage at Buenos Aires, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service reported.</p>
<p>The 26,741 dwt vessel partially obstructed navigation when it ran aground in the port south access channel early on Thursday. It has berthed for discharge.</p>
